FlashInfer FA2 prefill: keep the 64-byte tail of FP8 KV rows (QK=192 / VO=128).
Backport of flashinfer-ai/flashinfer#5085 (fixes #4976) onto the FlashInfer 0.7.0.post1
headers in the base image. Without it, FP8-KV prefill with head_dim 192 loads 128 of 192
columns and its smem offset drifts: wrong output, then an illegal memory access past
~25k KV tokens on GB10. FlashInfer is Apache-2.0; this file carries upstream's change.

